# The build context of deploy/docker/Dockerfile is the repository root; BuildKit reads this file because it sits next
# to the Dockerfile and has its name. Only the Rust workspace goes in: no target/, node_modules/, keys, logs or
# identity homes, and nothing that changes the image when it changes.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-toolchain.toml
!crates/
crates/*/target
